  "solution": {
    "text": "Let acceleration of $100 \\mathrm{~kg}$ block $=a_1$<br>FBD of $100 \\mathrm{~kg}$ block w.r.t ground<br><img src=\"assets\\st0073_e215c4a957c7.png\"><br>$\\mathrm{F}-\\mathrm{T}-\\mathrm{N}_1=100 \\mathrm{a}_1$ ... (i)<br>FBD of 20 block wrt $100 \\mathrm{~kg}$<br><img src=\"assets\\st0073_659170c86ce8.png\"><br>$\\mathrm{T}-20 \\mathrm{~g}=20(2)$<br>$\\mathrm{T}=240$ ... (ii)<br>$\\mathrm{~N}_1=20 \\mathrm{a}_1$ ... (iii)<br>FBD of $10 \\mathrm{~kg}$ block wrt $100 \\mathrm{~kg}$<br><img src=\"assets\\st0073_4ead57bf7e65.png\"><br>$10 \\mathrm{a}_1-240=10(2)$<br>$\\mathrm{a}_1=26 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$<br>$\\mathrm{~F}-240-20(26)=100 \\times 26$<br>$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{F}=3360 \\mathrm{~N}$"
